    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Infiltration Expertise</h2><p>You are expert at the following techniques that aid your infiltrations.</p><h3>Masterful Mimicry</h3><p>You can unerringly mimic another person's speech, handwriting, or both if you have spent at least 1 hour studying them.</p><h3>Roving Aim</h3><p>Your Speed isn't reduced to 0 by using Steady Aim.</p><p class=\"runyth-boundary\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Masterful Mimicry remains narrative. Roving Aim suppresses only the walking-speed-to-zero change originating from an activity or Item whose stable identifier is <code>steady-aim</code>.</p>",
